  "title": "Gooey Vegan Chocolate Chip Cookies",
  "description": "These vegan white chocolate chip cookies are made with applesauce, coconut oil, and cocoa powder to create moist and delicious treats for the whole family.",
  "authors": [
    "Nitzan Shlapobersky"
  ],
